Package: omp-instance-control
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Native ompi wrapper for participating OMP terminals
 Launches standard OMP through ompi and adds explicit scoped instance
 discovery and settled-boundary restart/resume in the same terminal.
 Includes the public-API JavaScript adapter loaded by an independently
 installed OMP executable. The native command does not require Node.js.
